6838	6926	6834	6834	Luke	366	" _ you _ need not boast of the connection ! ' Tis not for you , old man , to couple their names together -- to exult in your daughter 's disgrace and your own dishonor . Shame ! shame ! Speak not of them in the same breath , if you would not have me invoke curses on the dead ! _ I _ have no reverence -- whatever _ you _ may have -- for the seducer -- for the murderer of my mother . "
