8667	8667	8653	8653	Luke	366	"
8685	8693	8695	8695	Luke	366	" I will bear this no longer , "
8697	8727	8695	8695	Luke	366	" anger me not , or look to yourself . In a word , have you anything to tell me respecting her ? if not , let me begone . "
