11729	11754	11542	11542	Luke	366	" My heart will burst . Oh ! could I but establish the fact of this marriage , her wrongs would be indeed avenged . "
11755	11762	11764	11765	the sexton	1009	" Listen to me , Luke , "
11769	11802	11764	11765	the sexton	1009	" I told you , when I appointed this midnight interview , I had a secret to communicate . That secret is now revealed -- that secret was your mother 's marriage . "
11803	11814	11542	11542	Luke	366	" And it was known to you during her lifetime ? "
